{"id":"word:hebrew:H4283","type":"word","title":"מׇחֳרָת","subtitle":"H4283 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"the morrow or (adverbially) tomorrow","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to מׇחֳרָת (H4283) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: n-f.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 32 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"מׇחֳרָת (mochŏrâth) means the morrow or (adverbially) tomorrow First listed occurrence: 1Chr 10 8."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"מׇחֳרָת","transliteration":"mochŏrâth","pronunciation":"mokh-or-awth'","strong":"H4283","lemmaId":"hebrew:H4283","partOfSpeech":"n-f","forms":["מִֽ/מָּחֳרָ֔ת","מִֽ/מָּחֳרָ֗ת","מִֽ/מָּחֳרַ֤ת","לְֽ/מָחֳרַת֮","מִֽ/מָּחֳרָת֒"],"morphs":[["HR/Ncfsa",19],["HR/Ncfsc",7],["HC/R/Ncfsa",3],["HR/Ncfsc/Sp3mp",1],["HRd/Ncfsa",1],["HTd/Ncfsa",1]]},"definitions":{"short":"the morrow or (adverbially) tomorrow","usage":"morrow, next day.","full":"H4283. mochorath or mochoratham מָחֳרָת noun feminine the morrow (the day following a past day) — absolute ׳מ Gen 19:34 +, construct מָחֳרַת Lev 23:11 +; — the morrow , Num 11:32 הַמָּחֳרָת יוֺם וְכֹל ; מִמָּחֳרָת = on the morrow , so מִמָּחֳרָת וַיְהִי , Gen 19:34 ; Exod 18:13 ; 32:30 ; Numbers 17:23; Judg 9:42 ; 21:4 ; 1Sam 11:11 ; 18:10 ; 31:8 (= 1Chr 10:8 ) 2Kin 8:15 ; Jer 20:3 ; ( וַיַּשְׁכִּימוּ ) מִמָּחֳרָת וַיַּשְׁכֵּם , Exod 32:6 ; Judg 6:38 ; 1Sam 5:3-4 , Exod 9:6 ממ הזה ׳הדבר י ׳ויעשׂ את , Num 17:6 ; Josh 5:12 ; 2Sam 11:12 b: הַשַּׁבָּת מִמָּחֳרַת on the morrow of (= after) the sabbath, Lev 23:11 , 15 , 16 , ׳ממ הַמֶּסַח Num 33:3 ; Josh 5:11 , הַשֵּׁנִי מִמָּחֳרַת [ ᵐ5 בַּיּוֺם ] הַחֹדֶשׁ ( ᵑ0 falsely מִמָּחֳרָת ) 1Sam 20:27 ; of the morrow after a day specified in a law, Lev 19:6 וּמִמָּחֳרָת יֵאָכֵּל זִבְחֲכֶם בְּיוֺם , 7:16 . Twice (late) with לְ , Jonah 4:7 לַמָּחֳרָת on the morrow , 1Chr 29:21 הַהוּא הַיּוֺם לְמָחֳרַת . — 1Sam 30:17 strangely לְמָחֳרָתָם וְעַדהָֿעֶרֶב מֵהַנֶּשֶׁף דָּוִד וַיַּכֵּם from the dawn to the evening of their following day (We Bu לְהַחֲרִימָם ).","rootNote":"or מׇחֳרָתָם ; (1 Samuel 30:17), feminine from the same as 4279 ;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Chr 10 8","keyReferences":["1Chr 10 8","1Chr 29 21","1Sam 5 3","1Sam 5 4","1Sam 11 11","1Sam 18 10","1Sam 20 27","1Sam 30 17"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":32,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Chr 10 8","book":"1Chr","chapter":10,"verse":8,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"מִֽ/מָּחֳרָ֔ת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncfsa"},{"reference":"1Chr 29 21","book":"1Chr","chapter":29,"verse":21,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"לְֽ/מָחֳרַת֮","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncfsc"},{"reference":"1Sam 5 3","book":"1Sam","chapter":5,"verse":3,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"מִֽ/מָּחֳרָ֔ת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncfsa"},{"reference":"1Sam 5 4","book":"1Sam","chapter":5,"verse":4,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"מִֽ/מָּחֳרָת֒","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncfsa"},{"reference":"1Sam 11 11","book":"1Sam","chapter":11,"verse":11,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"מִֽ/מָּחֳרָ֗ת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncfsa"},{"reference":"1Sam 18 10","book":"1Sam","chapter":18,"verse":10,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"מִֽ/מָּחֳרָ֗ת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncfsa"},{"reference":"1Sam 20 27","book":"1Sam","chapter":20,"verse":27,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"מִֽ/מָּחֳרַ֤ת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncfsc"},{"reference":"1Sam 30 17","book":"1Sam","chapter":30,"verse":17,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"לְ/מָֽחֳרָתָ֑/ם","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncfsc/Sp3mp"},{"reference":"1Sam 31 8","book":"1Sam","chapter":31,"verse":8,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"מִֽ/מָּחֳרָ֔ת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncfsa"},{"reference":"2Kgs 8 15","book":"2Kgs","chapter":8,"verse":15,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"מִֽ/מָּחֳרָ֗ת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncfsa"},{"reference":"2Sam 11 12